desc = Attach beams to yourself, or spawn a beam on its own
beam.desc = The beam asset that gives the appearance
entity.desc = Attach a beam from you to another entity
entity.entity.desc = The entity to end the beam at. Defaults to the entity in view
position.desc = Attach a beam from you to a point above you
sourceNode.desc = The model node on you to start the beam from. Defaults to your position
targetNode.desc = The model node on the target entity to end the beam at. Defaults to its position
scale.desc = How wide the beam is at both ends, unless targetScale is given
targetScale.desc = How wide the beam is at the target end. Defaults to the value of the scale argument.
height.desc = How far above you the beam ends, in blocks
height.default = 5 blocks
spawn.desc = Spawn a beam that is not attached to anything else.
length.desc = How long the beam is, in blocks
length.default = 8 blocks
lifetime.desc = How long the beam lasts, in seconds
lifetime.default = 30 seconds
clear.desc = Remove the beams attached to you
attached = Attached the beam.
spawned = Spawned the beam.
cleared = Removed your beams.
noBeams = You have no beams to remove.
